WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.360
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.320
I'm a second-year exchange student at the idol middle school, Venus Ark.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:20.660
I work my hardest at Aikatsu every day as a top idol in S4!

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.330
My brand is Berry Parfait.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:31.420
I was having a tough time trying to come up with a design for my all-important Premium Rare Dress.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.510
But seeing the smiling faces of those girls made me realize.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.770
I want everyone wearing Berry Parfait to shine as brightly as they can.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.730
It was then that Elza-san told me I had no talent for design.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.570
Even though I couldn't get Star Wings, I feel like I gained 
something else, so I can't contain my excitement!

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.660
What is the meaning of this?

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:04.160
"What kind of person is Elza-san? What is Elza-san's favorite food?"

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.790
This one's asking us to give a profile of Elza-san.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.920
These letters are more of the same.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.840
Why are all these questions about 
Elza Forte coming to our S4 show?!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.890
Remember what Yume-chan said last time?

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.270
I'm challenging myself to new Aikatsu at Venus Ark! {this line was actually said on a totally different show last episode}

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:28.270
This is a response to that.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.230
Elza Forte of Venus Ark.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:37.410
She's well known worldwide, but this is her first time in Japan, so it's no wonder everyone's curious.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:40.910
Oh, then why don't we do an interview of Elza-san?

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.490
What did you say?!

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.490
What?!

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:47.080
Hey, Yume! You seriously want to talk about Elza-san on S4's show?!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.540
Yep! If that's what everyone's asking, I want to answer them.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.090
That gets me going!

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.720
My catchphrase...

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.970
If you know your enemy, you need not fear the result of a battle. {I was going to explain but probably don't need to}{}

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.100
While I understand your point...

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.850
An interview?

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:08.600
Yes, we'd like to do a feature on you on our program.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:13.610
Everyone, me included, wants to know much, much more about you.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:17.570
This is an opportune time for Japan to become acquainted with me.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.110
Do proceed and make whatever plans you wish.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:22.200
Thank you very much!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.590
Good morning!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.840
Good morning.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:08.100
Morning. I know that getting a head start is good, but isn't this a little too bright and early?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.350
When I did that full-day coverage of Hime-senpai...

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.230
She started her Aikatsu before dawn.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.440
So I figured Elza-san must be up and at her Aikatsu before anyone else.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:22.860
Look over there!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.920
Whoa!

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.290
He's good.{why didn't you fix my mistake?}

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.680
Yes!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.930
Yes!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:53.350
Huh? It looks like the sailor split into three.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.690
Me too... am I still asleep?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.940
Or seasick?

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.900
Those sailors are triplets.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.940
Triplets?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.440
No wonder they're identical.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.650
I can't tell them apart at all.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.490
Um, who are you?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.620
Bonjour, Yume-san.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.500
My name is Alice. I am a first-year student of Venus Ark.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.120
You just started?! But you're so good.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.130
She looks like a French doll. {notto dissu shitto again}

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:23.260
Elza-sama instructed me to escort you today.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.260
Really? Thanks in advance, Alice-chan.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.140
It is my pleasure.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.020
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.270
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.520
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.530
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.990
Wow, they're perfectly synchronized.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.660
When's our focus, Elza-san, going to wake up?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:55.290
Nobody knows. Only Elza-sama can decide when she wishes to awaken.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.920
That's pretty free-spirited of her.{this is one place where you can probably actually use "my pace"}

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:01.420
Good morning, Yume-chan, Rola, and Mahiru-chan.{wait, using the "and" is my thing}

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.880
Good morning.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.880
Morning.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:07.300
Sorry I can't help you, but I'm overloaded with design work right now.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:11.220
It's totally fine. Alice-chan is helping us out a lot.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:11.890
Right?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:15.350
Of course. This is the only way I can be of use.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.400
Elza-sama!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.860
Good day, ladies.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.690
Good day, Elza-sama!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:34.200
Today's steak was prepared from Yonezawa beef.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.830
Steak for breakfast! {reeses for breakfast?!}

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.660
Diving straight into the main course.{asd, etc.}

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.960
May I intrude?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.380
Steak makes for a very heavy breakfast.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.340
Is there a reason behind it?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.550
Only one—simply that I want to eat it.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.850
That's nice and simple!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.600
I'm not sure it's praiseworthy.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.470
A powerful way to start the day.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.480
Please indulge yourself in this as well.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.850
This fresh salad is also quite delicious.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.900
As I would expect.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.740
Let us move into the meeting.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.990
Me first, Elza-sama!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.870
Everyone invited to tonight's party sent in their RSVP!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:21.040
I see. Prepare accordingly, taking into account those who will bring a partner.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.120
Okay!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.750
We received a request for you to make an appearance on an American music show.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:31.260
Their terms are appealing, but are you able to visit their Los Angeles studio?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:34.970
I have no plans to depart Japan for the time being.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:39.270
Negotiate under the condition that they send their staff to us.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.480
She called it a meeting, but it's more like Elza-san is just ordering them around.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:47.780
At Venus Ark, Elza-sama's word is absolute.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.490
Pardon me, Elza-sama. {you know, I had "my pardons" originally, but I wonder where it came from}

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:56.410
I have brought today's letters.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.620
They are all from Venus Ark applicants.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.330
That many?!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.960
Take care of them as per usual.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.970
Understood. I will dispose of them summarily.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:23.270
H-Hold on a second! Why are you cutting them up?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.650
In order to protect their personal information.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.190
That's not what I meant!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.400
Why aren't you reading them?

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.030
And why must I do that? {for the response}

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:38.200
Venus Ark does not accept applications in the first place.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:42.200
People who ignore that and send them anyway are baa!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:46.790
Only idols I have scouted are allowed to step foot on this boat.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.090
Alice.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.590
Y-Yes!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.220
Get off my ship. {or disembark, but this is nice and simple}

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.220
Huh?

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:01.720
As of today, consider yourself expelled from Venus Ark.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.640
But why? Please tell me!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:10.480
Your brand's performance is in continuous decline.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:14.150
Though slow, attendance at your concerts is steadily decreasing.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:17.910
You have also fallen to last place in the Venus Ark popularity ranking.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.030
But—

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.870
Elza-sama's orders are absolute.{zettai nante shinjinai}

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:28.290
You have lost your brilliance, and along with it your right to remain at Venus Ark.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:37.680
Please hold on! Don't you think it's 
unreasonable to expel her like that?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:42.560
Didn't you scout her yourself?! 
Now you're just kicking her out?

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:48.020
Those who lack the ability must leave the stage. 
Is that not how professionals act?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:52.150
Are you sure you should be saying all that?

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.070
I'm still recording.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.400
I don't mind. This is Venus Ark.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:00.200
This is who I am.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.080
We're finished here.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:11.090
Alice, your last job is to escort them. See it through to the end.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.590
Wait!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:22.600
Elza-sama is busy. Get in her way and you get the baa!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.150
I had always admired Venus Ark.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.440
I wanted to be like Elza-sama...

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.570
It was the happiest day of my life when I was scouted,

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:43.580
but it seems that I had no talent.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:47.080
Elza-sama's orders are absolute.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.920
I have no choice but to leave.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:56.920
It's horrible of her to blindly reject every applicant and mercilessly throw out an active idol!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.630
She's like the total opposite of Four Star Academy.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.680
Are you sure about that?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:06.770
Her methods may be different, but I think our views on professionalism are basically the same.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:11.230
To tell you the truth, I had a similar experience with our own headmaster.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:15.650
He told me I'd be expelled if I couldn't show any results.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:22.530
Originally, my dream was to be exactly like my senpai in S4.

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.910
But then I realized that I shouldn't think like that.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.330
Because I can only be myself!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.710
My dream is to be the world's best idol!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.800
I promised myself I would do it, no matter what!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:44.260
Even if you leave Venus Ark, it's not over.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:46.390
So long as you have a dream...

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:50.390
As long as you have fans 
supporting you, you can't let it end!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.390
Yume-san...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.920
Is that spinach?

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.920
No, it's Japanese mustard spinach! {this sucks...}{this is fine}

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:33.770
Yes!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:38.320
Perfect Queen. That's Elza-san's brand. {uh... I guess for the girls who can't read it?}

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:43.450
A party is being held today for the valued customers of Perfect Queen.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:53.000
Even the slightest thing out of place for Elza-sama's party is baa!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.370
Right!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.210
That's some incredible work ethic.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.790
Yeah, I can feel their passion.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.510
Why would they act like that for someone so cold?

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.380
Move that decorative plant a bit more to the right.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.930
Sorry to bother you when you're so busy.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:11.390
Rei-san, I'd like to have a short interview with you. Do you mind?

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.060
Aren't you supposed to be filming Elza?

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:21.190
True, but then I noticed everyone at 
Venus Ark working so hard for Elza-san.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.900
I was wondering why.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:31.410
Considering that you're her right-hand woman, I thought we'd be able to learn more about her from you.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.170
How intriguing. I'm attracted to how she sees the world through a different lens.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:39.750
What exactly does Elza-san mean to you?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.920
My first star?

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.090
First star?

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:48.510
I heard a story about a certain model.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.220
She was born into an affluent household.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:59.480
In addition, she was blessed with the talent to excel in her studies and athletics without putting in much effort.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:06.740
She became a model at the insistence of those around her, 
and was surrounded by cheers and spotlights.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.740
It was then that she met Elza.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:19.920
What a dull show, utterly devoid of desire and passion.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.880
You are the worst model I have ever seen.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.340
She was shocked.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.470
She had heard nothing but praise her entire life.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:33.640
That was perhaps the first time anyone had said anything different.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.770
However, there is a glimmer inside you.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.650
Come with me. I will make you perfect.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.150
She had no idea who this person was.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:50.450
Despite that, she chose to go with her.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:58.540
Elza is a guiding light—shining strong like the beautiful first star.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:04.800
I see. Both you and that model came to really love Elza-san then.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.670
That's right...

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.050
What about you, Koharu-chan?

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:12.890
Huh?

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.180
Why did you board Venus Ark?

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:19.180
Well, Elza-sama is really strict...

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.190
She looks over my dress designs very thoroughly

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.690
and tears up everything she disapproves of.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:27.940
She tears them up?! Isn't that awful?

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:33.450
But the only ones she's torn up are the ones I didn't have much confidence in to begin with.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.330
You can't fool Elza-sama.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:41.580
She doesn't baby you and will hardly ever hand out compliments.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:45.170
So every time she does, you know it's honest and sincere.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:50.630
That's why it feels so good to be praised by Elza-sama!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.340
It makes me want to work even harder!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.640
That's a nice expression, Koharu-chan.{what's with that vaugery?}

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.100
Huh, you think so?

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:03.730
Yeah! When someone devotes themselves to something, their eyes sparkle just like stars. {what am I, the comma hater?}

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:18.080
Perfect Queen.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:22.410
I wish for all of you out there to wear my brand with pride.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:28.550
There are countless difficulties awaiting us on the voyage known as life.{jinsei wa koukai to iu funetabi da}

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:35.050
However, we must resolutely don our dresses and face the storm without wavering.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.850
I wish for you to believe in yourself and overcome the raging seas.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.180
Be as a proud queen.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:47.060
Push onward and strive to perfect yourself!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:55.360
Star Wings are the mark of a Star Premium Rare Coord. {this was messed up in 51 apparently}

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.490
Dresses strengthen me.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.640
For I am perfect!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.400
Elza-sama is indeed incredible!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.400
Yeah, she's wonderful!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.030
But...

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.120
Elza-sama!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.160
I will disembark.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.420
However, I have a dream.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.340
I have fans who support me.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.800
So I...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:44.800
I will Aikatsu with all my might, 
and become an idol who can match you!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.060
Good day.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:52.100
Merci! Thank you very much!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.600
Until we meet again!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.150
She's gone.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.270
But Alice-chan looks liberated.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:04.280
Yes! I feel so light after shouting what was in my heart.

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:08.700
Good luck, Alice-chan. I'll be cheering for you!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.910
Merci, Yume-san!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:19.290
Strict with a professional mindset are the words that best describe Elza-san.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:23.010
It sounds almost as though you're bragging about her.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:27.010
Because I am! I was excited the entire time we were covering her.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.760
Yeah, it was very motivational.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.640
I couldn't ask for a better rival!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.310
We'll have to step up our Aikatsu a notch to keep up with her!

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:40.400
See you next time!

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:47.450
How very intriguing. That was a rather positive presentation given that you're their greatest rival.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.450
I saw a glimmer.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:58.080
I had been certain that Alice would never shine again, yet in spite of that...

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:01.670
There was a light shining deep within her eyes.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:06.340
What kind of magic did Yume use?

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:09.840
It's something you can't do without a strong radiance of your own.

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:13.100
Yume Nijino.

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:23.280
I'm confident that she will be able to obtain a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:59.330
Perfect Queen's Blooming Queen Coord.

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:05.210
It contains the brand's red rose motif 
as well as gold embroidery and jewels.

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:10.050
It brings out your brilliance. Truly fit for a queen!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:13.510
A drama together with Subaru-kyun?!

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:15.760
Ako, you're too nervous!

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:18.560
Oh, I just got a great idea!

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:20.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:21.850
The feeling of love.

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:24.230
Become the first-star idol!
